		{
			description: [
				"The Guild keeps a second board for work that takes patience. Complete these &6one-time mastery bounties&r to claim a piece of equipment chosen for the hunt."
				""
				"Sign on below before setting out. All mastery hunts then run together: you do not need to finish a small contract first. Progress is shared with your FTB quest team."
				""
				"Your existing supply contracts remain on the &6Adventurers Guild&r page. Guild enrollment for recovering belongings still happens at the Desk or Agent; signing this board does not enroll you."
				""
				"Relic rewards have consistent starting stats and still need to be developed through use. Each player may claim their team's completed equipment reward once."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "minecraft:golden_sword"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
